# Copy to .env.local (never commit it). Everything here is optional.

# Where notes, the experience bank, essays and saved keys live.
# Default: %USERPROFILE%\.scholarship-essays (Windows) or ~/.scholarship-essays
# SE_DATA_DIR=

# Extra host names allowed to reach the API, comma-separated — needed when you
# open the app under a name other than localhost or an IP, e.g. through Tailscale:
# SE_ALLOWED_HOSTS=my-pc,my-pc.example-tailnet.ts.net

# Keys saved in Settings take precedence over these. Every provider in Settings
# Providers read standard variable names, e.g. GEMINI_API_KEY, OPENROUTER_API_KEY,
# XAI_API_KEY, GROQ_API_KEY, MISTRAL_API_KEY, DEEPSEEK_API_KEY, TOGETHER_API_KEY.
# Point one provider at a proxy or regional endpoint with SE_BASE_URL_<PROVIDER>,
# e.g. SE_BASE_URL_OPENROUTER=https://proxy.example.com/v1
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# OPENAI_API_KEY=
# CUSTOM_LLM_API_KEY=
# DEEPGRAM_API_KEY=
